              "blocks": {
                "text_w7KCdz": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>For beginners, we strongly recommend:</p><ul><li><strong>Start with 10 - 15mg:</strong> 1 gummy or quarter of a 50mg cookie</li><li><strong>Wait 1.5 hours:</strong> Effects can take 30-90 minutes to appear</li><li><strong>Don't re-dose early:</strong> This is the #1 mistake beginners make.</li><li><strong>Have a plan:</strong> Clear schedule, safe environment, trusted friend nearby. (If new to cannabis)</li></ul>",
