              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_WBXfVe": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Proper storage is crucial for safety and potency:</p><ul><li><strong>Keep in original packaging:</strong> Maintains labeling and child safety</li><li><strong>Store in cool, dry place:</strong> Avoid heat, light, and moisture</li><li><strong>Refrigerate if needed:</strong> Some edibles can be frozen and maintain potency. be sure to thaw fully before enjoying.</li><li><strong>Child-proof location:</strong> Locked box or high cabinet</li><li><strong>Away from pets:</strong> Cannabis is toxic to dogs and cats</li></ul><h4>⚠️ Child Safety Priority</h4><p>Cannabis edibles often look like regular food. Always store securely and never leave accessible to children or pets.</p>",
