              "blocks": {
                "text_BtnJC6": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>You can order as a guest, but creating an account offers benefits:</p><ul><li>Faster checkout with saved addresses</li><li>Order history and easy reordering</li><li>Loyalty program and reward points</li><li>Early access to Thursday drops</li><li>Surprise Gifts  </li></ul>",
